  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A major fire recently occurred at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy production facility located in Cikande, Serang Regency, Banten. The incident has drawn significant attention as emergency services work to navigate the site, which has been hampered by persistent hot spots and hazardous air quality, forcing temporary pauses in recovery efforts. Regional police and government representatives have expressed condolences as search and rescue teams continue to process the scene. Current data indicates a total of 63 victims associated with the factory, with 24 remains recovered so far for forensic processing. The Disaster Victim Identification team is working to match DNA samples from family members to facilitate formal identification. Legislative members have formally raised concerns regarding the tragedy, and authorities are currently prioritizing the safety of responders while the investigation into the cause and scale of the fire proceeds.",
